01:29:39.600 --> 01:29:40.420
du travail d'entrepôt,

01:29:40.520 --> 01:29:41.220
l'application a besoin

01:29:41.220 --> 01:29:41.880
d'un chemin défini

01:29:41.880 --> 01:29:42.940
