01:44:27.390 --> 01:44:28.230
prouve l'amélioration

01:44:28.230 --> 01:44:29.070
du flux partagé.

01:44:30.030 --> 01:44:30.890
Les exceptions doivent également

01:44:30.890 --> 01:44:31.410
